  "scope": "Chosen-target destination policy uses fixed numeric values and a single-use owner receipt. Creature safe references plus map context lifetime protect commit from destruction/removal, changed actor/target inputs, changed turn, goal conflicts and cancelled/reused receipts. Preceding sensing, triggers, conditional RNG and movement effects stay in their existing owner order; full planning and renderer stages remain pending.",
