  "contracts": [
    "The pure destination function reads only source/target coordinates, hostile/fleeing booleans and owner-selected flight z. It does not query a world or consume RNG.",
    "Only the owner envelope holds Creature/map weak references; workers are not authorized to read live state through these references.",
    "Commit consumes a receipt once, verifies lifetimes and tracker membership, context/origin/turn, positions, goal/move budget/policy and exact expected output before setting a goal.",
    "Flight floor validity is checked again on the owner; changed inputs discard the output.",
    "Map context expires on load or coordinate-context replacement, at destruction before cleanup and on both sides of move assignment. Move retirement allocates nothing; a new reference allocates only lazily.",
    "Existing tracker membership query is now a const-input owner interface; no unconditional UID scan and no new Lua surface."
  ],
